    monster in your hand, Deck, or face-up field, except "Sacred Fire King Garunix",
    and if you do, this card gains ATK equal to half the destroyed monster''s ATK
    it had there, until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Sacred
    Fire King Garunix" once per turn.'
